{# The way back to the home of the account (architecture §5.2), said the same way on every page that has
   one: a page of the account belongs to no client and to no interaction, so the home is the only place it
   returns to. The page where a user answers what was asked of them somewhere else (§4.14) has one too,
   whether they reached it from the home or from a notification: a user who has answered, or who had nothing
   to answer, is not left on a page with no way out. The home itself hangs from nothing and includes this
   not. Overridable by an application under templates/bundles/BeffroiBundle/. #}
{% trans_default_domain 'beffroi' %}
<nav><a href="{{ path('beffroi_interaction_account') }}" data-back>{{ 'account.back'|trans }}</a></nav>
